  "raw_text_content": "Blalock Seafood & Specialty Market - Seafood Market in Gulf Shores, AL. Premier source for fresh seafood on the Alabama Gulf Coast. High-quality seafood and gourmet items for more than 10 years. Best locally caught seafood. Contact: (251) 968-5811. Address: 1901 Gulf Shores Pkwy, Gulf Shores, AL 36542. Hours: Monday-Saturday 9:00 AM - 6:00 PM, Sunday 9:00 AM - 4:00 PM. Services: Free Pack to Travel - professional wrapping and sealing of purchases for safe travel. Steamed Meal Solutions - steamed meal options with favorite seafood products. Products: Fresh Fish, Steamed Food, Shrimp, Crab Legs, Gourmet Seasonings, Gourmet Dry Rubs, Fine Cheese, Dips, Marinades. Famous items: Shrimp Bisque, Smoked Tuna Dip, Frozen Hush Puppies. Serve customers in Gulf Shores, Orange Beach, Foley. Awards: People's Choice Award for Best Seafood Market. 10+ years in business. Flexible hours, convenient access, knowledgeable staff. Testimonials praise friendly staff, cleanliness, large assortment, awesome crab legs, decent prices. Social media: Facebook - BlalocksSeafood, Yelp, Google Maps, Email.",
